  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements :</p><p><strong>Statement I :</strong> Electromagnetic waves are not deflected by electric and magnetic field.</p><p><strong>Statement II :</strong> The amplitude of electric field and the magnetic field in electromagnetic waves are&nbsp;related to each other as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "X76c4",
      "text": "Statement I is true but statement II is false",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
